# OmniPaxos (library, Rust) vs S_raft (hand-written) and S_paper (derived, revision 3) at (1,1,1) and (2,1,1), offline first, no practical time
# limit (100 days; owner 2026-11-06: "run it on the offline engine, not on the online engine; once it got answers there, run it on the online").
# The 48 h attempts (brain05, 2026-11-03) timed out on the implementation's export at both sizes. The in-process rows wait for their join.
C3E.omnipaxos.impl_correct_1_1_1_fifo.t16.cinf 250 8640000 "$DAAVAR"/scripts/rust-run.sh omnipaxos export impl --out export.jsonl --threads 16 --model fifo -- correct 1 1 1
